<title>USA: TENNIS-SATURDAY'S RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SATURDAY'S RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Florida 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>U.S. Men's Clay Court Championships on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat 6-Chris Woodruff (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-4</p>
</text>
